    {
      "id": 139033,
      "name": "Silverleaf",
      "username": "Silverleaf",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-08T14:21:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Craig\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/48/2150_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Craig:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><b>Silverleaf wrote:</b></p>\n<div><blockquote>Strangely, I actually know where Corpus Christi is. I know nothing more about it, however.This may or may not be related to the fact that I will be in Dallas for BGGCon in November, if all things go well.</blockquote></div>\nOh, really? There are potentially going to be a couple of us there, too. No promises, though. \n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>We're working out the logistics but I have a con pass and a bed so far. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> A BGG member set up a \"scholarship\" for a small number of women who can't afford to go to BGGCon and I applied and got one of the places. Yay!</p>\n<p>It would be awesome to meet anyone who's around. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:15:40.399Z",
